From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] ovn: enable multi-networkpolicy

enable-multi-networkpolicy=true, the MultiNetworkPolicy CRD (from
cluster-network-operator) in MicroShift's CRD list so it exists before
OVN-K starts, and the controller's rights to watch it. Needs 0001.

Covered by: vm-test (a MultiNetworkPolicy cuts a pod off the layer2
network and its removal restores it).
---
